</div>

<div class="container my-5 text-start border-top pt-4">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Why Learn Selenium with C#?</h2>
    <p class="fs-5">C# combined with Selenium WebDriver is one of the most powerful and in-demand skill sets in the software testing industry. Companies like Microsoft, Amazon, Infosys, TCS, and Accenture actively seek automation engineers proficient in C# Selenium frameworks.</p>
    
    <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>Industry Demand</h4>
            <p>According to job market trends, Selenium with C# is among the top 5 most requested automation testing skills. With .NET being the backbone of enterprise applications, C# testers have access to high-paying positions in banking, healthcare, e-commerce, and fintech industries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h4>Robust Ecosystem</h4>
            <p>The .NET ecosystem provides powerful tools like NUnit, SpecFlow, ExtentReports, and RestSharp that integrate seamlessly with Selenium. This makes building comprehensive test automation frameworks faster and more maintainable than other language alternatives.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5 text-start border-top pt-4">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Our Free AI-Powered Tools</h2>
    
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                    <h1 class="mb-3">📚</h1>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">AI Tutor</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">Complete structured roadmap from C# fundamentals to advanced Selenium Grid, CI/CD, and Docker. AI-generated explanations with production-ready code examples for every topic.</p>
                    <a href="/learn" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Start Learning</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                    <h1 class="mb-3">🐛</h1>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Debug Bot</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">Paste your C# Selenium code and error message. Our AI instantly analyzes NoSuchElementException, StaleElementReferenceException, TimeoutException, and provides fixes with explanations.</p>
                    <a href="/debug" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">Fix an Error</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                    <h1 class="mb-3">🎤</h1>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Interview Prep</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">Practice real QA automation interview questions. Get AI-powered feedback on your answers using the STAR method. Perfect for SDET and QA Engineer interviews.</p>
                    <a href="/interview" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm">Practice Now</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5 text-start border-top pt-4">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">What You Will Learn</h2>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>C# Fundamentals</b> — Variables, OOP, Collections, LINQ</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Selenium Basics</b> — WebDriver setup, Locators (ID, XPath, CSS)</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Synchronization</b> — Implicit, Explicit, Fluent Waits</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Advanced Interactions</b> — Alerts, Frames, Windows, Shadow DOM</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Page Object Model</b> — Scalable framework architecture</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>NUnit Framework</b> — Test organization, Assertions, Attributes</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Data-Driven Testing</b> — Excel, JSON, CSV data sources</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Parallel Execution</b> — Multi-browser, multi-thread testing</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>CI/CD Integration</b> — Jenkins, Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions</li>
                <li class="mb-3">✅ <b>Docker & Selenium Grid</b> — Containerized test infrastructure</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5 text-start border-top pt-4">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
    <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
        <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">
                    Is this platform completely free?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    Yes! All learning content, tutorials, and code examples are completely free. Our AI tools (Debug Bot and Interview Prep) use a daily token system that refreshes every 24 hours, giving you free access to AI-powered features every day.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">
                    Do I need prior programming experience?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    Our platform starts from C# fundamentals, so complete beginners can start their journey. However, basic understanding of programming concepts will help you progress faster through the curriculum.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">
                    What makes this different from other Selenium tutorials?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    Unlike static tutorials, our platform uses AI to provide personalized debugging help, adaptive learning content, and real-time interview feedback. You can paste your actual code errors and get instant solutions specific to your problem.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">
                    Which version of Selenium does this cover?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                    Our content covers Selenium 4.x with C# (.NET 6/7/8+). We regularly update our code examples to reflect the latest Selenium WebDriver APIs and best practices, including the new relative locators and BiDi protocol.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

